 "files_modified": [],
 "notation": "R = root chat's Flywheel session ID. C = chat provider conversation identity, reused from metadata or initially `agent-${randomUUID()}`. T = title runner's fresh `agent-${randomUUID()}`. S = subagent's childConversationId. K = clamp(R), limited to the first 64 Unicode code points. All header identity values below also pass through that clamp. Evidence: src/orchestration/chat/runner-lifecycle.ts:124-128,361-375; src/orchestration/agent-runtime/runner.ts:62-68; src/orchestration/modules/subagents/execution/child-execution.ts:463-468; src/orchestration/agent-runtime/llm/openai-prompt-cache.ts:5-11; src/orchestration/agent-runtime/llm/openai-helpers.ts:256-260.",
