   "evidence": "Chat supplies its sessionId as treeRootSessionId to title generation: src/orchestration/chat/session.ts:285-300. Title runner forwards that root but uses conversation kind stateless: src/orchestration/session/session-title.ts:286-309. Stateless conversation takes the generated fallback identity: src/orchestration/agent-runtime/runtime-conversation.ts:80-85; src/orchestration/agent-runtime/runner.ts:62-68. Cache key remains treeRoot: src/orchestration/agent-runtime/request-inputs.ts:524,659-662. Body and headers: src/orchestration/agent-runtime/llm/openai-helpers.ts:221-235,252-260."
