   "chatgpt_subscription": {
    "body": "prompt_cache_key = K",
    "session_headers": "session-id = K; session_id = K; x-client-request-id = clamp(S)",
    "opts_out": "No"
   },
   "evidence": "Child runner has purpose subagent and its own durable conversation/providerSessionKey: src/orchestration/modules/subagents/execution/child-execution.ts:317-321,463-468. Child inherits the sessions authority: src/orchestration/modules/subagents/execution/child-execution.ts:393-397; src/orchestration/agent-runtime/tools/tool-registry.ts:268-283. Request planning reads the session identity's rootSessionId and uses that as promptCacheKey: src/orchestration/agent-runtime/request-inputs.ts:212-213,524,659-662. Session identity computes the top of the parent chain: src/orchestration/session/session-messaging.ts:127-128,212-225,489-496. Body and headers: src/orchestration/agent-runtime/llm/openai-helpers.ts:221-235,252-260."
