 "causal_trace": [
  "Both routes use the same Responses adapter. API-key module calls createOpenAIAdapter with kind apiKey: src/orchestration/modules/provider-openai-api/module.ts:72-80. Subscription module calls it with kind chatgpt: src/orchestration/modules/provider-chatgpt/module.ts:95-99. Adapter determines isChatGPT from auth.kind and chooses openai_api/chatgpt attribution: src/orchestration/agent-runtime/llm/openai.ts:62-71.",
  "Request planning sets the cache key to the tree root, not model, route, or individual conversation identity: src/orchestration/agent-runtime/request-inputs.ts:524,659-662. The session authority returns the chat itself as root and follows a child's parent chain: src/orchestration/session/session-messaging.ts:127-128,212-225,489-496.",
  "Ordinary turn construction preserves both independent values, and the Responses preparer calls the shared body builder: src/orchestration/agent-runtime/agent-loop.ts:494-497; src/orchestration/agent-runtime/assistant-turn-attempt.ts:136-148; src/orchestration/agent-runtime/llm/openai-responses.ts:20-45.",
