  "These requested purposes select positive cache lifetimes: interactive/unattended chat defaults to 1h, and title/subagent defaults to 5m: src/orchestration/agent-runtime/request-kernel.ts:50-66; src/orchestration/agent-runtime/request-inputs.ts:659. Compaction uses the existing loop's value, with no separate override: src/orchestration/agent-runtime/agent-loop.ts:385-389,494-497.",
  "Configured provider retention can replace the default, but the policy schema has no none option: src/infra/llm/provider-options.ts:7-14. Resolution preserves explicit none if a caller supplied it; otherwise it takes the configured policy/default: src/orchestration/agent-runtime/llm/types.ts:509-512. The Responses preparer applies that resolution: src/orchestration/agent-runtime/llm/openai-responses.ts:20-21.",
